  "details": "The SDK Control Panel’s Alerts section should let you know with a warning if your current SDK version is older than latest. \n\nA lot of folks just forget they need to update the SDK themselves or, like me, may wish to wait a while for new bugs to be squashed before updating. But it’s really easy to just forget you haven’t made that decision yet and end up losing out on new features in the end.\n\nThis can create a bit of a feedback loop, with players suggesting bug fixes or features that may already exist because they haven’t realized they haven’t updated versions lately.",
